We are still sitting in the hall.
Lena asks about my job.
"How was your first day in the office?" she asks.
I smile and tell her about my first day.
"First I met my colleague Jonas," I say.
"Then I unpacked the laptop from the backpack."
"Jonas and I drank a coffee together."
"And at the same time I organised my desk," I continue.
Lena nods interestedly.
"And what exactly do you do in the office now?" she asks.
"Yesterday Jonas and I finished a big project," I answer proudly.
"We worked really hard last week."
"But we finally managed it!"
Lena is happy for me.
"That sounds like a great team," she says.
